### Enhancements

* Add `include_stdin` and `include_stderr` keyword-only arguments to
  `conda.common.terminal.is_tty()` so callers can additionally require stdin
  and/or stderr to be a TTY (e.g. `is_tty(include_stdin=True)`), closing the
  gap left after the `IS_INTERACTIVE` deprecation. (#16594)

